:: Mansion Bathroom
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_bathroom">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>


<<avery_mansion_contents>>

:: Mansion Bathe
<<effects>>
<<strip>>
<<wearProp "soap">>
<<wash>>

You lower yourself into Avery's bath. You don't think you'll ever get used to its size, but the multiple taps fill it quick enough.
<br><br>
You wash yourself, and rise, squeaky clean.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Bathroom]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
<br>


:: Mansion Bathe Avery
<<effects>>
<<npc Avery>><<person1>>
<<strip>>
<<wearProp "soap">>
<<wash>>
You undress, and slip into the bathe opposite Avery. There's plenty of empty space, even with two of you. Avery observes you a moment, then closes <<his>> eyes and leans back.
<br><br>

<<link [[Tease Avery|Mansion Bathe Tease]]>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
<br>
<<link [[Just wash|Mansion Bathe Wash]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Bathe Wash
<<effects>>

You leave Avery alone, and focus on washing yourself.
<br><br>

You rise from the bath, get dry, and get dressed.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Bathroom]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>


:: Mansion Bathe Tease
<<effects>>

You push your foot between Avery's leg's. <<His>> eyes widen in surprise.
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"Sorry," you say. "My foot slipped."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"You like that?" you ask.
<<else>>
	"What's the matter?" you ask.
<</if>>
<<promiscuity1>>

"Keep your feet to yourself," Avery says. "I'm thinking." <<He>> turns away.
<br><br>

<<link [[Keep teasing|Mansion Bathe Tease 2]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Just wash|Mansion Bathe Wash]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Bathe Tease 2
<<effects>>

You rise as if to leave the bath, but step between Avery's legs as you do. Your foot comes down on Avery's groin. You lift your foot, and flash Avery an apologetic smirk.
<br><br>

Without warning, Avery rises, water cascading, and pushes you against the wall.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Bathe Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>


