:: Mansion Mickey Interrupt
<<effects>><<summon_brown_fox 1>><<person1>>

"Psst."
<br><br>
You look in the direction of the voice. Mickey hides in the shade of a tree, and waves you over.
<br><br>

"I'm here about that job Landry gave you," they say. "The wishing stones. I'm on it too. I've been attacking Avery from every angle, but I'm not finding much. Wherever the stones are, they're off-grid."
<br><br>

Mickey pauses, and looks anywhere but your eyes, as if ashamed. "I haven't found the stones, but I've found other things. Avery has," they pause again. "Intense tastes." They pause yet again, then fix you with their gaze, determined to say their piece. "<span class="pink">If Avery felt dominant,</span> <<nnpc_he Avery>> might slip up. Reveal the stones' location. Nothing to fear from <<nnpc_his Avery>> 'pet', right? I know I know, it's messed up, but it's an option."
<br><br>

Mickey shakes their hands, as if removing something filthy. "There must be another way, but it's beyond me. I'm sorry. Avery has a plan for them. The stones. <span class="pink">If <<nnpc_he Avery>> finishes <<nnpc_his Avery>> skyscraper,</span> then it could be too late."
<br><br>

A hand reaches out from behind the tree and ruffles Mickey's hair, making them jump.
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.known>>
	The brown fox emerges. "When the hand nears midnight, the world will tremble."
	Mickey swats <<his>> hand away. "Your approach is up to you. You're the field agents. The ones in the thick of it. I'll keep doing what I can." Mickey glances over their shoulder. "Good luck." They turn and leave, weaving between the trees.
	<br><br>

	The brown fox only lingers for a moment. "You'll hear from me soon. I may have a lead, thanks to the little one." <<He>> folds <<his>> hands in front of <<himself>> and bows, before following Mickey.
	<<set $avery_mansion.mickey to 1>><<set $avery_mansion.fox.progress++>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	A figure in a green hooded cloak emerges, their face obscured by a brown fox mask. The same one you saw talking with Landry.
	"When the hand nears midnight, the world will tremble." It's a <<personsimple>>'s voice, soothing like gentle birdsong despite the weight of <<his>> words.
	<br><br>

	Mickey swats <<his>> hand away. "Your approach is up to you. You're the field agents. The ones in the thick of it. I'll keep doing what I can." Mickey glances over their shoulder. "Good luck." They turn and leave, weaving between the trees.
	<br><br>

	The fox-masked <<personsimple>> steps towards you in their place. <<He>> leans forward, a hand to <<his>> chin.
	<<His>> eyes are entirely darkened by <<his>> mask, but you see the faintest hint of green within. <<His>> head moves around yours as if studying you.
	<<set $avery_mansion.mickey to 1>><<set $avery_mansion.fox.progress++>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Ask who <<he>> is|Mansion Brown Fox Interrupt 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Ask why <<he>> wants to 'help' Avery|Mansion Brown Fox Interrupt 2]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Say nothing|Mansion Brown Fox Interrupt 2]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Brown Fox Interrupt
<<effects>><<summon_brown_fox 1>><<person1>>
"Ever restless."
<br><br>

A <<personsimple>>'s voice makes you jump. You look towards the direction it came from, and see a figure in a hooded green cloak leaning against a tree.
<<He>> turns, revealing that <<hes>> wearing a brown fox mask. <span class="blue">The same one you saw speaking with Landry.</span>
<br><br>

"Have you had any luck finding the clutching bones? Or wishing stones, if you prefer?" <<His>> voice is gentle and soothing like birdsong. You snap out of it, and shake your head. <<He>> smiles patiently.
"Nor have I. They'll be hidden deep, deep down. Near the bottom, perhaps. They're Avery's lifeline to a life <<nnpc_he "Avery">> believes will make <<nnpc_him "Avery">> whole."
<<He>> shakes <<his>> head. "It will only leave larger <span class="purple">holes</span>. In <<nnpc_him "Avery">>, and the world."
<br><br>

<<link [[Ask who <<he>> is|Mansion Brown Fox Interrupt 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
