:: Mansion Brown Fox Interrupt 2
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	"<span class="green">I'm the brown fox.</span> Because I jump over the lazy hounds. I already know you, though.
	<span class="teal"><<overworld_nickname "cap">></span> to the layperson, or <span class="pink"><<underworld_nickname "cap">></span> to those underneath. It's hard not to know about someone so interesting."
	<<He>> clicks <<his>> tongue. "Look at you, making me answer questions for free."
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	<<His>> head tilts to the side. "Avery's heart is rotten to the core, but no one deserves to die in a cage. <<nnpc_He "Avery">> means to build one for <<nnpc_himself "Avery">>, and call it paradise."
	<<He>> clicks <<his>> tongue. "Look at you, making me answer questions for free."
<<else>>
	You say nothing and look away from <<him>>. <<He>> simply steps around you, continuing to look into your eyes.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> steps away.
<<if $avery_mansion.mickey>>
	"Landry and Mickey both trust you. I suppose I'll have to, as well."
<<else>>
	"We'll see if Landry's trust was placed well."
<</if>>
<<He>> smiles warmly.
<<if $phase isnot 1>>
	"Ah! I usually work alone, so I've forgotten my manners. <span class="green">I'm the brown fox.</span>" <<He>> reaches forward, lifts your hand, and shakes it in both <<his>> own.
	"Because I jump over the lazy hounds. I already know you, though. <span class="teal"><<overworld_nickname "cap">></span> to the layperson, or <span class="pink"><<underworld_nickname "cap">></span> to those underneath. It's hard not to know about someone so interesting.
	If you need me, <span class="blue">ask for me from our mutual friend</span>. I'd like to know who Avery's next guest of honour is."
<<else>>
	"Ah! I usually work alone, so I've forgotten my manners." <<He>> reaches forward, lifts your hand, and shakes it in both <<his>> own. "It was a pleasure to meet you, even though we aren't really strangers.
	If you need me, <span class="blue">ask for me from our mutual friend</span>. I'd like to know who Avery's next guest of honour is."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> folds <<his>> hands in front of <<himself>> and bows. <<He>> darts off between the trees.
<<set $avery_mansion.fox.known to true>><<set $avery_mansion.fox.met ||= "Mansion">>
