	<<link [[Search the bin|Mansion Folder Search]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Get angry|Mansion Folder Angry]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Silently accept it|Mansion Folder Silent]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<gdom>><<glove>>
	<br>
<</if>>

