You walk over to the bin. It's empty.
<br><br>
"Don't bother," Avery says, emerging from the wardrobe with a fresh pair of shoes. "It's not here, and would have been shredded by now anyway."
<br><br>

<<link [[Get angry|Mansion Folder Angry]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>>
<br>
